  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Implementing the Edits**\n\nI\'ve begun implementing the surgical edits as planned. I started with `index.html`, replacing \"Hershita\" with \"Nova.\" Now, I\'m working through `src/data/salonData.ts`, updating the name and founder details accordingly. The bio changes are next on the list.\n\n\n**Updating the Details**\n\nI\'ve just finished the bulk of the textual replacements! The \"Hershita\" to \"Nova\" updates are complete in `src/App.tsx`, `src/components/AboutSection.tsx`, `src/components/InteractiveChapters.tsx`, `src/components/RollingMarble.tsx`, `src/components/Header.tsx`, and `src/components/TreatmentsSection.tsx`. I also updated the comments in `src/components/Footer.tsx`. Now I\'m shifting focus to the removal of the replay button and corresponding code in `src/App.tsx`.\n\n\n"
