  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Executing Test Suite**\n\nI\'m currently focused on scripting a Playwright test suite. I\'m aiming to open Chromium, resize the window to 1440x900, capture snapshots and screenshots, and ensure a clean exit regardless of interruptions. Specifically, I\'m integrating a trap command to guarantee the browser closes upon exiting the script. I\'m trying to make a complete test script.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
