\"Close-up editorial beauty film showing luminous natural skin texture and botanical serum ritual\" [ref=e20]\n          - generic [ref=e21]: Scroll to enter \342\206\223\n        - img \"Close-up editorial beauty portrait showing luminous natural skin texture\" [ref=e25]\n      - region \"Sanctuary Introduction\" [ref=e26]:\n        - generic [ref=e27]:\n          - img \"Serene close-up beauty portrait with warm natural shadows and radiant skin\" [ref=e31]\n          - generic [ref=e32]:\n            - heading \"At Maison Aura, we honour the quiet intelligence of the skin. Visit our sanctuary for unhurried rituals shaped around your natural rhythm.\" [level=2] [ref=e33]\n            - generic [ref=e34]:\n              - paragraph [ref=e35]: True radiance rarely comes from haste. Every appointment begins with attentive listening\342\200\224observing how you live, how your skin responds to the season, and what brings you a sense of calm restoration.\n              - button \"Book an appointment\" [ref=e37] [cursor=pointer]\n      - region [ref=e38]:\n        - generic [ref=e39]:\n          - generic [ref=e41]:\n            - generic [ref=e42]: 1:4\n            - heading \"Why Nova?\" [level=2] [ref=e43]\n            - generic [ref=e44]:\n              - button \"Previous chapter\" [ref=e45] [cursor=pointer]: \342\206\220\n              - button \"Next chapter\" [ref=e46] [cursor=pointer]: \342\206\222\n          - generic [ref=e48]:\n            - article [ref=e49]:\n              - button \"Serene facial treatment ritual in warm diffused light (1). Active Chapter A considered experience More than an appointment, Maison Aura is a quiet pause. From warm linen and softened acoustics to unhurried transition time between rituals, every detail is composed to restore stillness.\" [pressed] [ref=e50] [cursor=pointer]:\n                - generic \"Serene facial treatment ritual in warm diffused light\" [ref=e53]\n                - generic [ref=e54]:\n                  - generic [ref=e55]:\n                    - text: (1).\n                    - generic [ref=e56]: Active Chapter\n                  - generic [ref=e57]:\n                    - heading \"A considered experience\" [level=3] [ref=e58]\n                    - paragraph [ref=e59]: More than an appointment, Maison Aura is a quiet pause. From warm linen and softened acoustics to unhurried transition time between rituals, every detail is composed to restore stillness.\n            - article [ref=e60]:\n              - button \"Macro beauty portrait highlighting natural skin texture and hydration (2). Care tailored to you No two complexions or schedules are alike. Each facial, manicure, or makeup session is adapted on the day of your visit to match your skin\342\200\231s current condition and personal preferences.\" [ref=e61] [cursor=pointer]:\n                - generic \"Macro beauty portrait highlighting natural skin texture and hydration\" [ref=e64]\n                - generic [ref=e65]:\n                  - generic [ref=e66]: (2).\n                  - generic [ref=e67]:\n                    - heading \"Care tailored to you\" [level=3] [ref=e68]\n                    - paragraph [ref=e69]: No two complexions or schedules are alike. Each facial, manicure, or makeup session is adapted on the day of your visit to match your skin\342\200\231s current condition and personal preferences.\n            - article [ref=e70]:\n              - button \"Esthetician hands performing a precise, gentle facial massage (3). Skilled beauty professionals Our estheticians, nail artists, and makeup specialists unite refined manual technique with a gentle, observant touch\342\200\224prioritizing comfort, hygiene, and timeless aesthetic harmony.\" [ref=e71] [cursor=pointer]:\n                - generic \"Esthetician hands performing a precise, gentle facial massage\" [ref=e74]\n                - generic [ref=e75]:\n                  - generic [ref=e76]: (3).\n                  - generic [ref=e77]:\n      