inous hydration. Selected\" [expanded] [ref=e146] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - generic [ref=e147]:\n                    - generic [ref=e148]: (01).\n                    - generic [ref=e149]:\n                      - heading \"Facials and skin treatments\" [level=3] [ref=e150]\n                      - paragraph [ref=e151]: Restorative manual sculpting, barrier nourishment, and luminous hydration.\n                  - generic [ref=e152]: Selected\n                - generic [ref=e153]:\n                  - paragraph [ref=e154]: Our facial treatments focus on gentle surface renewal, lymphatic drainage, and deep moisture replenishment. Every session begins with a quiet skin reading so masks, oils, and massage pressure are attuned to how your complexion feels today.\n                  - generic [ref=e155]:\n                    - generic [ref=e156]:\n                      - generic [ref=e157]:\n                        - generic [ref=e158]:\n                          - heading \"The Maison Aura Signature Facial\" [level=4] [ref=e159]\n                          - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=e160]: \302\267\n                          - generic [ref=e161]: 75 min\n                          - generic [aria-hidden] [ref=e162]: \302\267\n                          - generic [ref=e163]: $190 (Example)\n                        - paragraph [ref=e164]: A customized ritual combining double botanical cleansing, gentle enzymatic polish, extended sculptural facial massage, and a bespoke hydro-soothing mask.\n                        - paragraph [ref=e165]: Skin consultation \302\267 Sculptural buccal & lymphatic massage \302\267 Custom botanical mask \302\267 Scalp & neck release\n                      - button \"Reserve ritual\" [ref=e166] [cursor=pointer]\n                    - generic [ref=e167]:\n                      - generic [ref=e168]:\n                        - generic [ref=e169]:\n                          - heading \"Barrier Calm & Moisture Infusion\" [level=4] [ref=e17