  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing the Request Details**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the specific requirements, particularly the image replacement and the desired two-column layout. I am noting the need for a macro photograph of natural skin texture as the main visual, edge-to-edge on the left side, and am considering the \"elegant\" design constraint, and all relevant details in order to follow them correctly.\n\n\n**Defining the Visual Concept**\n\nNow, I\'m forming a precise picture in my mind: a warm ivory background setting, elegant serif for the heading \"Beauty begins with care,\" contrasted by minimal sans-serif for the description, all in muted earthy tones. I\'m focusing on that subtle parallax effect for a premium feel. The image reveal and smooth text entrance are key elements for this upscale brand.\n\n\n**Clarifying the Timeline**\n\nOkay, I\'ve got it. It seems the user wants the macro skin photo *instead* of the \"spread-left-lips.jpg\" image that currently appears right after the hero video. The structure in `src/App.tsx` clarifies the sequence of events. I need to make the change precisely after the first hero stage. I am on the same page now, fully understanding the request as a direct replacement in the code.\n\n\n**Visualizing the Layout**\n\nI\'m now picturing the layout: a macro shot on the left, full height, showing natural skin texture, with a warm ivory background on the right, filled with refined typography and whitespace. The text hierarchy is clear, with \"THE ART OF SKINCARE\" as a subtle eyebrow text, followed by \"Beauty begins with care.\" as the main heading, a concise description, and a CTA. My goal is to create a seamless transition from the opening video.\n\n\n**Refining the Section Structure**\n\nI\'m now integrating the detailed section requirements. The focus is now on the precise placement of the macro image and the specific text elements. I\'m focusing on the scroll-linked reveal for the left column photo and the staggered entrance animation of the text. The colours and fonts are coming together, now, for a smooth integration of design elements.\n\n\n**Structuring the Elements**\n\nI\'m now prioritizing the mobile layout, ensuring the macro image stacks above the text. Then, I am checking `Header.tsx` to align the sticky top bar with the warm ivory background, which should transition after scrolling past the hero. I\'m focusing on creating a new modular component, `ArtOfSkincareSection.tsx`, to integrate smoothly after the first hero section, replacing the old \"introduction\" section.\n\n\n**Confirming Scope Clarity**\n\nI\'m now completely clear on the scope! The user specifically wants the macro image to *replace* the section immediately following the hero video, which was previously Stage B. It\'s a direct replacement, and I\'ve confirmed this understanding by carefully analyzing the flow of the instructions from the last two turns, confirming no ambiguity exists regarding section placement.\n\n\n**Implementing the Reveal Effect**\n\nI\'m now integrating the macro skin photograph into a two-column layout. I\'ve confirmed that `motion` is installed. I\'m focusing on the image reveal and parallax effects using `useScroll` and `useTransform`. The plan is to create an editorial curtain reveal combined with a subtle scale settle on entry, while translating the image vertically on scroll to mimic the parallax. I\'ll use staggered, upward fade-in animations for the text elements to match the elegance requested.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_2271982437837585594"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import React, { useRef } from \'react\';\\nimport { motion, useScroll, useTransform } from \'motion/react\';\\n\\ninterface ArtOfSkincareSectionProps {\\n  onExploreTreatments: () => void;\\n}\\n\\nexport const ART_OF_SKINCARE_CONTENT = {\\n  eyebrow: \'THE ART OF SKINCARE\',\\n  heading: \'Beauty begins with care.\',\\n  description:\\n    \'Discover personalised skincare experiences designed to bring out your natural beauty.\',\\n  cta: \'EXPLORE TREATMENTS \342\206\227\',\\n  imagePath:\\n    \'/assets/aistudio/Generated_Image_November_17__2026_-_4_59PM_6977a387.jpg\',\\n  imageAlt:\\n    \'Macro editorial photograph showing natural skin texture, pores and facial details\',\\n};\\n\\n/**\\n * Odyss\303\251e-inspired Two-Column Editorial Split Section immediately following the Opening Hero.\\n * - Left: Large, edge-to-edge macro photograph with scroll-triggered reveal & subtle parallax.\\n * - Right: Warm ivory/beige background (#F6F2EB) with refined serif/sans typography,\\n *   muted earthy tones, generous whitespace, and smooth staggered entrance animations.\\n * - Mobile: Stacks the macro photograph above the text column.\\n */\\nexport const ArtOfSkincareSection: React.FC<ArtOfSkincareSectionProps> = ({\\n  onExploreTreatments,\\n}) => {\\n  const sectionRef = useRef<HTMLElement | null>(null);\\n\\n  const { scrollYProgress } = useScroll({\\n    target: sectionRef,\\n    offset: [\'start end\', \'end start\'],\\n  });\\n\\n  // Subtle vertical parallax movement on the macro skin image as the user scrolls\\n  const imageParallaxY = useTransform(scrollYProgress, [0, 1], [\'-6%\', \'6%\']);\\n\\n  return (\\n    <section\\n      ref={sectionRef}\\n      id=\\\"art-of-skincare\\\"\\n      aria-labelledby=\\\"art-of-skincare-heading\\\"\\n      className=\\\"relative w-full bg-[#F6F2EB] text-[#2B2522] overflow-hidden\\\"\\n    >\\n      <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 min-h-[88vh]\\\">\\n        {/* Left Column: Edge-to-Edge Macro Skin Photograph (Stacks on top on mobile) */}\\n        <div className=\\\"relative w-full aspect-[4/4.5] sm:aspect-[16/11] lg:aspect-auto lg:min-h-[88vh] overflow-hidden bg-[#E5DDD3]\\\">\\n          {/* Sophisticated scroll reveal wrapper */}\\n          <motion.div\\n            initial={{ clipPath: \'inset(12% 0% 12% 0%)\', scale: 1.08, opacity: 0.85 }}\\n            whileInView={{ clipPath: \'inset(0% 0% 0% 0%)\', scale: 1, opacity: 1 }}\\n            viewport={{ once: true, amount: 0.2 }}\\n            transition={{ duration: 1.35, ease: [0.22, 1, 0.36, 1] }}\\n            className=\\\"relative h-full w-full\\\"\\n          >\\n            <motion.img\\n              src={ART_OF_SKINCARE_CONTENT.imagePath}\\n              alt={ART_OF_SKINCARE_CONTENT.imageAlt}\\n              style={{ y: imageParallaxY }}\\n              className=\\\"h-[114%] w-full max-w-none object-cover object-center -top-[7%] relative select-none\\\"\\n            />\\n          </motion.div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Right Column: Warm Ivory/Beige Editorial Canvas with Generous Whitespace */}\\n        <div className=\\\"flex flex-col justify-center bg-[#F6F2EB] px-7 py-16 sm:px-14 sm:py-24 lg:px-20 xl:px-28 lg:py-28\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"max-w-md space-y-8 md:space-y-10\\\">\\n            {/* Eyebrow */}\\n            <motion.span\\n              initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 18 }}\\n              whileInView={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}\\n              viewport={{ once: true, amount: 0.35 }}\\n              transition={{ duration: 0.8, delay: 0.1, ease: [0.22, 1, 0.36, 1] }}\\n              className=\\\"block font-sans text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-[#7A6F66]\\\"\\n            >\\n              {ART_OF_SKINCARE_CONTENT.eyebrow}\\n            </motion.span>\\n\\n            {/* Editorial Serif Heading */}\\n            <motion.h2\\n              id=\\\"art-of-skincare-heading\\\"\\n              initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 24 }}\\n              whileInView={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}\\n              viewport={{ once: true, amount: 0.35 }}\\n              transition={{ duration: 0.9, delay: 0.22, ease: [0.22, 1, 0.36, 1] }}\\n              className=\\\"font-serif-editorial text-4xl sm:text-5xl xl:text-[3.65rem] font-light leading-[1.08] tracking-[-0.01em] text-[#2B2522]\\\"\\n            >\\n              {ART_OF_SKINCARE_CONTENT.heading}\\n            </motion.h2>\\n\\n            {/* Minimal Sans-Serif Supporting Description */}\\n            <motion.p\\n              initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 22 }}\\n              whileInView={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}\\n              viewport={{ once: true, amount: 0.35 }}\\n              transition={{ duration: 0.9, delay: 0.34, ease: [0.22, 1, 0.36, 1] }}\\n              className=\\\"font-sans text-[15px] sm:text-base font-light leading-[1.75] text-[#5F554E] max-w-sm\\\"\\n            >\\n              {ART_OF_SKINCARE_CONTENT.description}\\n            </motion.p>\\n\\n            {/* Minimalist Editorial CTA */}\\n            <motion.div\\n              initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 18 }}\\n              whileInView={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}\\n              viewport={{ once: true, amount: 0.35 }}\\n              transition={{ duration: 0.85, delay: 0.46, ease: [0.22, 1, 0.36, 1] }}\\n              className=\\\"pt-2\\\"\\n            >\\n              <button\\n                type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                onClick={onExploreTreatments}\\n                className=\\\"group cursor-pointer inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-sans text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#2B2522] border-b border-[#2B2522]/35 pb-2 hover:border-[#2B2522] hover:text-[#5F554E] transition-colors whitespace-nowrap\\\"\\n              >\\n                <span>{ART_OF_SKINCARE_CONTENT.cta}</span>\\n              </button>\\n            </motion.div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n  );\\n};\\n\",\"Description\":\"Create A