              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "      \'Every ritual at Maison Aura is guided by restraint, tactile skill, and respect for your natural features. We favour thoughtful consistency over aggressive trends.\',"
