  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Image Refinement**\n\nI\'ve been closely examining `/src/assets/images/nova_intro_blended_portrait_1794935262087.jpg`. My focus is on how it maintains the original model and posture from the user\'s portrait. I\'m also noting the clever transformation of the backdrop into a warm, luminous ivory alabaster, specifically using the color `#FBF9`.\n\n\n**Refining Background Blending**\n\nI\'ve made progress refining the background blending! I switched from `bg-[#E6E2DA]` to `bg-[#FBF9F5]` for the page background to eliminate a gray-beige rectangle behind the image. I implemented soft edge feathering overlays with gradients from `#FBF9F5` to transparent, plus `mix-blend-multiply`, which removes harsh boundaries. I also ensured image paths are correctly referenced as URL strings in `salonData.ts` to avoid `tsx` crashes.\n\n\n"
