                  </h2>\n\n                  <div className=\"max-w-sm space-y-6\">\n                    <p className=\"text-[14px] leading-[1.6] text-[#18224B]/90\">\n                      {introduction.body}\n                    </p>\n                    <div>\n                      <button\n                        type=\"button\"\n                        onClick={() => handleOpenBooking()}\n                        className=\"cursor-pointer text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[#18224B] hover:opacity-60 transition-opacity whitespace-nowrap shrink-0\"\n                      >\n                        {introduction.ctaLabel}\n                      </button>\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </section>"
