  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing the White Space**\n\nOkay, I\'ve tracked down the source of that massive white gap after the introduction section. It turns out the culprit was a double dose of excessive padding. The `#introduction` section in `src/App.tsx` had a hefty `pb-28 md:pb-40` value (160px bottom padding)! Additionally, `InteractiveChapters.tsx` also contributed with its own `py-24 md:py-36` padding!\n\n\n**Refining the Spacing**\n\nI\'ve determined that the combined padding from `#introduction` and `InteractiveChapters.tsx` totals a significant 304px of whitespace. I propose reducing the bottom padding of the `#introduction` and adjusting `InteractiveChapters.tsx`\'s padding for a more editorial feel. Also, I\'ve checked the quote in `src/data/salonData.ts` to ensure we use original Nova copy rather than using Odyss\303\251e\'s text. I\'m crafting a headline now that should be: `\'At Nova, we believe beauty is a personal expression of who you are. Step into our sanctuary for unhurried rituals shaped around your natural rhythm.\'`\n\n\n"
