              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "      \'Every ritual at Maison Aura is guided by restraint, tactile skill, and respect for your natural features. We favour thoughtful consistency over aggressive trends.\',"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "    paragraphs: ["
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "      \'We believe the most meaningful beauty treatments do not seek to disguise who you are. Instead, they create the quiet conditions in which healthy skin, cared-for hands, and unforced confidence can surface naturally.\',"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
            }
            lines {
              text: "      \'From the temperature of our compresses to the pacing of our consultations, nothing is rushed and nothing is standardized. We take the time to understand what feels restorative to you.\',"
              type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
