  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Planning Implementation Steps**\n\nI\'ve got `gsap` installed now. My current focus is designing pure helper functions in `src/utils/bookingLogic.ts`, with corresponding unit tests in `src/utils/bookingLogic.test.ts`. After that, the plan is to construct the coordinated GSAP ScrollTrigger storytelling experience in `src/components/Interactive`.\n\n\n**Refining State Resolution**\n\nI\'m now diving into the specifics of scroll-story logic within `src/utils/bookingLogic.ts`. I\'ve added padding to the chapter counters and am building the `resolveScrollStoryState` function. This helper will map scroll progress to `activeIndex`, `storyProgress`, and `portalRevealProgress`. This will streamline the GSAP `ScrollTrigger`\'s `onUpdate` function.\n\n\n**Detailing Component Architecture**\n\nI\'m now completely immersed in `src/components/InteractiveChapters.tsx`, meticulously planning the visual choreography. The goal is a seamless experience: no jarring jumps, no flashes, and definitely no duplicate sections. I\'m focusing on the `InteractiveChaptersProps`, the desktop GSAP `ScrollTrigger` timeline with its pinned container, and the two coordinated layers. I\'m aiming for ARIA states in complete sync with the GSAP timeline.\n\n\n**Defining Visual Hierarchy**\n\nI\'m now deep in the structure of Layer A (`ref={chaptersStageRef}`), specifically the four-panel story. I\'m focusing on the top horizon progress header, including the dynamic slide counter, chapter buttons, and a progress indicator that should smoothly transition with the scroll. I\'m building out the hairline track and active progress bar, and working on the full-width subtle fill line\'s scaling.\n\n\n**Constructing Panel Details**\n\nI\'m now zeroed in on building the individual panels within Layer B. Each panel will have a media wrapper with an aspect ratio and a slot for media, which I\'m calling `<MediaSlot />`. I\'m using GSAP for subtle animations. I\'m focusing on smooth scaling and clip-path framing for visual distinctions, with a warm veil overlay. The editorial copy, including the index, title, description, and detail note, will also be animated with GSAP for a polished fade-in effect. I\'m also planning for interactive click/keyboard support while the chapter is pinned.\n\n\n**Elaborating Portal Transitions**\n\nI\'m now detailing the dual portals section, specifically Layer B\'s implementation. My focus is the GSAP timeline transition from the final slide into \"CONCERNS / TREATMENTS.\" I\'m carefully mapping the overlapping animations across the slides, including the veil fades, copy opacity/positioning, media scaling, and progress bar scrubs. The goal is to ensure a smooth, intuitive transition between these sections.\n\n\n**Mapping Timeline Sequences**\n\nI\'m now detailing the GSAP timeline from the final slide transition. This includes transitioning from `Slide 03 / 04` to `Slide 04 / 04`, with the corresponding progress bar animations. After a brief pause on the fourth ritual chapter, the overlapping section emerges, where the chapters stage recedes, and the portals stage rises, with accompanying scale and opacity transitions, and specific portal frame clipping adjustments.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_1046342873604552471"
      name: "replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"AllowMultiple\":false,\"Description\":\"Add padded counter formatting (01 / 04) and pure scroll-story state resolver in bookingLogic.ts\",\"EndLine\":63,\"Instruction\":\"Update formatChapterCounter and add resolveScrollStoryState in src/utils/bookingLogic.ts\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"export function formatChapterCounter(activeIndex: number, total: number): {\\n  current: string;\\n  total: string;\\n  combined: string;\\n  paddedCurrent: string;\\n  paddedTotal: string;\\n  paddedSlash: string;\\n} {\\n  const safeTotal = Math.max(1, total);\\n  const clamped = Math.min(Math.max(1, activeIndex), safeTotal);\\n  const paddedCurrent = String(clamped).padStart(2, \'0\');\\n  const paddedTotal = String(safeTotal).padStart(2, \'0\');\\n  return {\\n    current: String(clamped),\\n    total: String(safeTotal),\\n    combined: `${clamped} : ${safeTotal}`,\\n    paddedCurrent,\\n    paddedTotal,\\n    paddedSlash: `${paddedCurrent} / ${paddedTotal}`,\\n  };\\n}\\n\\nexport function resolveScrollStoryState(\\n  progress: number,\\n  totalChapters: number = 4\\n): {\\n  activeIndex: number;\\n  chapterProgress: number;\\n  portalRevealProgress: number;\\n  isPortalInteractive: boolean;\\n} {\\n  const clampedProgress = Math.min(1, Math.max(0, progress));\\n  const safeTotal = Math.max(1, totalChapters);\\n  // First 73% of timeline drives the 4 horizontal chapters; final 27% emerges the Concerns/Treatments portals\\n  const chapterPhaseEnd = 0.73;\\n  const portalPhaseStart = 0.71;\\n\\n  const chapterProgress = Math.min(1, Math.max(0, clampedProgress / chapterPhaseEnd));\\n  const rawIndex = Math.floor(chapterProgress * safeTotal) + 1;\\n  const activeIndex = Math.min(safeTotal, Math.max(1, rawIndex));\\n\\n  const portalRevealProgress =\\n    clampedProgress <= portalPhaseStart\\n      ? 0\\n      : Math.min(1, (clampedProgress - portalPhaseStart) / (1 - portalPhaseStart));\\n\\n  return {\\n    activeIndex,\\n    chapterProgress,\\n    portalRevealProgress,\\n    isPortalInteractive: portalRevealProgress > 0.45,\\n  };\\n}\\n\\nexport function getNextChapterIndex(currentIndex: number, total: number, direction: \'next\' | \'prev\'): number {\\n  if (total <= 1) return 1;\\n  if (direction === \'next\') {\\n    return currentIndex >= total ? 1 : currentIndex + 1;\\n  }\\n  return currentIndex <= 1 ? total : currentIndex - 1;\\n}\",\"StartLine\":42,\"TargetContent\":\"export function formatChapterCounter(activeIndex: number, total: number): {\\n  current: string;\\n  total: string;\\n  combined: string;\\n} {\\n  const safeTotal = Math.max(1, total);\\n  const clamped = Math.min(Math.max(1, activeIndex), safeTotal);\\n  return {\\n    current: String(clamped),\\n    total: String(safeTotal),\\n    combined: `${clamped} : ${safeTotal}`,\\n  };\\n}\\n\\nexport function getNextChapterIndex(currentIndex: number, total: number, direction: \'next\' | \'prev\'): number {\\n  if (total <= 1) return 1;\\n  if (direction === \'next\') {\\n    return currentIndex >= total ? 1 : currentIndex + 1;\\n  }\\n  return currentIndex <= 1 ? total : currentIndex - 1;\\n}\",\"TargetFile\":\"/src/utils/bookingLogic.ts\",\"toolAction\":\"Adding padded slide counter and scroll-story state resolver to bookingLogic.ts\",\"toolSummary\":\"Update bookingLogic.ts with scroll-story helpers\"}"
