    thinking: "**Comparing Image Details**\n\nI\'m currently comparing two images: `.playwright-cli/r15-our-philosophy.png` and `image_62f75fc9.png`. My focus is on the top of the videos below \"EXPLORE TREATMENTS\" in both images, looking for two specific details.\n\n\n**Analyzing Visual Alignment**\n\nI\'ve discovered the top edges of the videos align horizontally in the new image due to `items-start` alignment and adjusted column spans. In our previous screenshot, the left video was lower because of `items-center` in the grid and a different column span on the right video. Also, the heading in the new image now wraps into 5 lines, as opposed to the 6 we had previously. I\'m considering smaller font sizes and adjusted padding to achieve the same result.\n\n\n"
