  checkpoint {
    checkpoint_index: 1
    session_summary: "<summary>\n## 1. Task Overview\n- **Core Request**: In the `Our Philosophy` section (`/src/App.tsx`, lines 288\342\200\223350) of the **NOVA \342\200\224 Maison Aura** beauty & skin sanctuary website, make the smaller left-center monochrome video and caption (`lg:col-start-5 lg:col-span-2`: *\"Behind every treatment lies a commitment to science, research and refinement, ensuring results that are safe, precise and enduring.\"*) scroll/glide downward alongside the taller right-hand macro video (`lg:col-start-7 lg:col-span-5`) as the user scrolls past the bigger right-hand video, matching the reference behavior shown in `/public/assets/aistudio/image_77d66d8b.png`.\n- **Scope & Constraints**:\n  - Do NOT invoke `generate_image` unless explicitly requested.\n  - Keep `TreatmentsSection` off the main home page (`activePage === \'home\'`); it only renders on the dedicated `treatments` page (`activePage === \'treatments\'`).\n  - Keep every occurrence of `NOVA` styled in `font-brand` (`Cabin Sketch`) and all editorial serif statements in light optical display serif (`font-serif-editorial font-light`, `opsz 72`).\n\n## 2. Progress\n- **Completed Earlier in Session**:\n  - Replaced the Sanctuary Introduction portrait with `/images/nova-intro-portrait.jpg` (copied from `/src/assets/images/nova_intro_blended_portrait_1794935262087.jpg`) in a studio-blended `#EBEAE6` rectangular frame (`/src/App.tsx`, `/src/data/salonData.ts`).\n  - Updated Sanctuary Introduction copy to original NOVA copy (`\"At NOVA, we believe beauty is a personal expression of who you are. Step into our sanctuary for unhurried rituals shaped around your natural rhythm.\"`) and tightened vertical spacing between `#introduction` and `#our-approach`.\n  - Installed `gsap` and implemented a coordinated GSAP + `ScrollTrigger` pinned 4-panel horizontal storytelling experience in `/src/components/InteractiveChapters.tsx` with dynamic `01 / 04` counter, thin scrubbed progress bar, and seamless emergence of the `CONCERNS` and `TREATMENTS` duotone portals before releasing the pin.\n  - Added pure helper `resolveScrollStoryState` and `paddedSlash` counter formatting in `/src/utils/bookingLogic.ts` and unit tests in `/src/utils/bookingLogic.test.ts` (all 7 tests passing via `npx --yes tsx --test src/utils/bookingLogic.test.ts`).\n  - Styled every occurrence of `NOVA` across `/src/App.tsx`, `/src/components/Header.tsx`, `/src/components/InteractiveChapters.tsx`, `/src/components/TreatmentsSection.tsx`, `/src/components/AboutSection.tsx`, and `/src/components/Footer.tsx` in `font-brand` (`Cabin Sketch`), and set `font-weight: 300` + `font-variation-settings: \'opsz\' 72` on `.font-serif-editorial` in `/src/index.css`.\n  - Reduced the font size of the `Our Philosophy` statement in `/src/App.tsx` (`text-[1.35rem] sm:text-[1.55rem] lg:text-[1.72rem] xl:text-[1.82rem]`) and removed `TreatmentsSection` from the `home` view in `/src/App.tsx`.\n- **Skills & References Read**:\n  - `/skills/system_skills/frontend_design/SKILL.md`\n  - `/skills/system_skills/frontend_design/references/1_ecommerce_retail.md`\n  - `/skills/system_skills/ultra_mode/SKILL.md` and `/skills/system_skills/computer_use/SKILL.md` (already active in context)\n- **In Progress (Current Turn)**:\n  - Inspected `/src/App.tsx` lines 1\342\200\22390 and 280\342\200\223365 to implement the scroll-following small left video + caption alongside the taller right-hand video in `Our Philosophy` Part B (lines 316\342\200\223349). No edits have been made yet for this latest user request.\n\n## 3. Key Findings\n- In `/src/App.tsx` (lines 316\342\200\223349), the `Our Philosophy` Part B dual-video grid currently has:\n  - Left column (`lg:col-start-5 lg:col-span-2`): `aspect-[4/5]` small monochrome video + caption (~340px total height).\n  - Right column (`lg:col-start-7 lg:col-span-5`): `aspect-[4/5] lg:aspect-[4/4.8]` (~660px height).\n- For the small left video + caption to visibly scroll/travel downward alongside the bigger right-hand video as the user scrolls:\n  1. The outer 12-column grid in Part B should use `items-stretch` on desktop (`lg:items-stretch`), and the right-hand video (`lg:col-start-7 lg:col-span-5`) should be tall (`lg:h-[125vh] lg:min-h-[860px]`).\n  2. The left column (`lg:col-start-5 lg:col-span-2 relative`) stretches to the full height of the right-hand video, and its inner wrapper (`lg:sticky lg:top-24` and/or GSAP `ScrollTrigger` scrub/pin) glides smoothly from the top of the right-hand video all the way down until its bottom aligns with the bottom of the right-hand video.\n\n## 4. Errors & Fixes\n- **Oval Vignette on Portrait**: Initially used a radial vignette overlay on the introduction portrait, which made it look like a floating oval. Replaced with a clean rectangular frame (`bg-[#EBEAE6]`, `mix-blend-multiply`) matching the user\'s reference screenshot `/public/assets/aistudio/image_0c2f72bb.png`.\n- **Reference Quote & Gap**: User requested not using Odyss\303\251e\'s literal quote (`\"Visit our Hunters Hill space...\"`) and reducing the white gap after `#introduction`. Replaced with original NOVA copy and reduced `#introduction` bottom padding to `pb-10 md:pb-14` and `InteractiveChapters` top padding to `pt-8 md:pt-10`.\n\n## 5. Active Context\n- Dev server is running on `http://localhost:3000`.\n- App supports `?autostart=1` query param to bypass the opening curtain animation during Playwright verification.\n- `gsap` (`^3.x`) is installed in `package.json` and used in `/src/components/InteractiveChapters.tsx`.\n\n## 6. Next Steps\n1. **Update `/src/App.tsx` (lines 316\342\200\223350)**:\n   - Make the Part B dual-video container in `Our Philosophy` use `lg:items-stretch`.\n   - Set the right-hand bigger video (`lg:col-start-7 lg:col-span-5`) to a tall editorial height (`aspect-[4/5] lg:aspect-auto lg:h-[125vh] lg:min-h-[860px]`).\n   - Make the left-center small video + caption card (`lg:col-start-5 lg:col-span-2`) follow the user\'s scroll along the full height of the bigger right-hand video using `lg:sticky lg:top-24` (and optional GSAP `ScrollTrigger` scrub synchronization) so it starts aligned with the top of the big video and travels down with the scroll until the bottom of the big video is reached.\n2. **Compile, Lint & Restart Dev Server**:\n   - Co-execute `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` in the same turn, and run `restart_dev_server`.\n3. **Browser Verification (`playwright-cli`)**:\n   - Open `http://localhost:3000/?autostart=1` at `1440x900`.\n   - Scroll to the top of the `Our Philosophy` dual-video section and take a screenshot, then scroll halfway down the tall right-hand video (`window.scrollBy(0, 450)`) and take a second screenshot verifying that the small left video + caption scrolls downward alongside the bigger right-hand video and that console has 0 errors.\n\n## 7. Commitments & Constraints\n- Follow all `ultra-mode` and `frontend-design` rules: verify in a real headless Chromium browser via `playwright-cli`, inspect screenshots, and co-execute `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` on the final build check.\n- Maintain `Cabin Sketch` (`font-brand`) on all `NOVA` occurrences and light optical serif (`font-serif-editorial`) on editorial headings.\n</summary>"
