ians, nail artists, and makeup specialists unite refined manual technique with a gentle, observant touch\342\200\224prioritizing comfort, hygiene, and timeless aesthetic harmony.\n              - article [ref=e87]:\n                - button \"Close-up of elegant hands and natural manicure ritual (4). The art of everyday rituals We believe beauty should feel effortless long after you leave our chair. We pair in-salon treatments with simple, sustainable home rituals that support healthy skin and nails every day.\" [ref=e88] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - generic \"Close-up of elegant hands and natural manicure ritual\" [ref=e92]\n                  - generic [ref=e93]:\n                    - generic [ref=e94]: (4).\n                    - generic [ref=e95]:\n                      - heading \"The art of everyday rituals\" [level=3] [ref=e96]\n                      - paragraph [ref=e97]: We believe beauty should feel effortless long after you leave our chair. We pair in-salon treatments with simple, sustainable home rituals that support healthy skin and nails every day.\n        - region \"Concerns and Treatments Portals\":\n          - generic:\n            - button \"Skin concerns and bespoke consultations Concerns\":\n              - img \"Skin concerns and bespoke consultations\"\n              - generic: Concerns\n            - button \"Treatments and aesthetic artistry Treatments\":\n              - img \"Treatments and aesthetic artistry\"\n              - generic: Treatments\n      - region \"Our Philosophy and Method\" [ref=e98]:\n        - generic [ref=e99]:\n          - generic [ref=e100]: Our Philosophy\n          - generic [ref=e101]:\n            - heading \"Every treatment at NOVA is grounded in evidence-based skincare and the quiet art of aesthetic refinement. Our specialists combine anatomical precision with restorative techniques to achieve results that are both gentle and enduring.\" [level=3] [ref=e102]\n            - button \"Explore treatment