  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing the Positioning**\n\nI\'ve been examining the screenshot `/philosophy-scroll-mid.png`. It\'s clear that `philosophy-dual-video-grid` maintains its position at `top: 390px` because the `InteractiveChapters` component generated its pin-spacer during the initial scroll operation (`window.scrollTo({ top: topY })`). This observation is helping me clarify the scroll behavior.\n\n\n"
