  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining ScrollTrigger Video**\n\nI\'m currently focused on refining the GSAP `ScrollTrigger` implementation for the \"Our Philosophy\" section in `/src/App.tsx`. The goal is to make the tall video look more vertical and visually impactful. Specifically, I am analyzing the sizing and layout, currently `lg:col-start-7 lg:col-span-5`, to optimize the vertical proportion during scrolling, ensuring an engaging user experience.\n\n\n**Optimizing Vertical Video Layout**\n\nI\'ve been iterating on the vertical video layout, aiming for maximum visual impact. I\'ve adjusted the dimensions to achieve a more pronounced vertical \"editorial column\" aspect ratio, specifically `lg:col-start-7 lg:col-span-5 aspect-[3/4.6] lg:aspect-auto lg:h-[168vh] lg:min-h-[1260px]`. I verified these dimensions on a `1440x900` desktop, resulting in a dramatic `564px x 1512px` rectangle (`1 : 2.68` ratio).\n\nI am going to attach ref attributes to enable smooth scrolling. I will be attaching `philosophyGridRef`, `philosophySmallCardRef`, and `philosophyLargeCardRef`.\nI will be using `gsap.matchMedia()` for `(min-width: 1024px)` (when `activePage === \'home\'`).\n\n\n**Analyzing ScrollTrigger Animations**\n\nI\'m now diving into the `ScrollTrigger` animation details. I\'m focusing on the `start` and `end` configurations, specifically `\'top 22%\'` and `\'bottom 86%\'`. The `scrub: 0.25` setting and `invalidateOnRefresh: true` are crucial for responsiveness. I\'m visualizing how the `smallCard` translates vertically, from `y: 0` to a calculated `y` value, perfectly in sync with the scroll position across the big video section, ensuring a flush alignment at the end. I\'m checking each stage of the animation to ensure a smooth, intuitive transition.\n\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_348156210985552878"
      name: "multi_replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"Description\":\"Make the right-hand Philosophy video significantly more vertical and use GSAP ScrollTrigger scrub so the smaller left video and caption scroll all the way to the very bottom end of the bigger video\",\"Instruction\":\"Add gsap and ScrollTrigger imports, refs, and a scrubbed ScrollTrigger effect in /src/App.tsx so the small left video and caption travel from top (y: 0) all the way to the bottom edge of the tall vertical right-hand video.\",\"ReplacementChunks\":[{\"AllowMultiple\":false,\"EndLine\":17,\"ReplacementContent\":\"import React, { useEffect, useRef, useState } from \'react\';\\nimport gsap from \'gsap\';\\nimport { ScrollTrigger } from \'gsap/ScrollTrigger\';\\nimport { SALON_CONFIG } from \'./data/salonData\';\\nimport { ActivePage, Header } from \'./components/Header\';\\nimport { MediaSlot } from \'./components/MediaSlot\';\\nimport { InteractiveChapters } from \'./components/InteractiveChapters\';\\nimport { TreatmentsSection } from \'./components/TreatmentsSection\';\\nimport { AboutSection } from \'./components/AboutSection\';\\nimport { BookingDrawer } from \'./components/BookingDrawer\';\\nimport { Footer } from \'./components/Footer\';\\nimport { ConfirmedDemoBooking } from \'./utils/bookingLogic\';\\n\\ngsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\\n\\nexport default function App() {\",\"StartLine\":6,\"TargetContent\":\"import React, { useEffect, useState } from \'react\';\\nimport { SALON_CONFIG } from \'./data/salonData\';\\nimport { ActivePage, Header } from \'./components/Header\';\\nimport { MediaSlot } from \'./components/MediaSlot\';\\nimport { InteractiveChapters } from \'./components/InteractiveChapters\';\\nimport { TreatmentsSection } from \'./components/TreatmentsSection\';\\nimport { AboutSection } from \'./components/AboutSection\';\\nimport { BookingDrawer } from \'./components/BookingDrawer\';\\nimport { Footer } from \'./components/Footer\';\\nimport { ConfirmedDemoBooking } from \'./utils/bookingLogic\';\\n\\nexport default function App() {\"},{\"AllowMultiple\":false,\"EndLine\":48,\"ReplacementContent\":\"  const [savedBookings, setSavedBookings] = useState<ConfirmedDemoBooking[]>([]);\\n\\n  const philosophyGridRef = useRef<HTMLDivElement | null>(null);\\n  const philosophySmallCardRef = useRef<HTMLDivElement | null>(null);\\n  const philosophyLargeCardRef = useRef<HTMLDivElement | null>(null);\\n\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    if (openingStage === \'complete\') return;\\n    const t1 = window.setTimeout(() => {\\n      setOpeningStage(\'revealing\');\\n    }, 450);\\n    const t2 = window.setTimeout(() => {\\n      setOpeningStage(\'complete\');\\n    }, 1500);\\n    return () => {\\n      window.clearTimeout(t1);\\n      window.clearTimeout(t2);\\n    };\\n  }, [openingStage]);\\n\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    if (activePage !== \'home\') return;\\n    const gridEl = philosophyGridRef.current;\\n    const smallEl = philosophySmallCardRef.current;\\n    const largeEl = philosophyLargeCardRef.current;\\n    if (!gridEl || !smallEl || !largeEl) return;\\n\\n    const mm = gsap.matchMedia();\\n\\n    mm.add(\'(min-width: 1024px)\', () => {\\n      gsap.set(smallEl, { y: 0 });\\n\\n      const getMaxTravel = () =>\\n        Math.max(0, largeEl.offsetHeight - smallEl.offsetHeight);\\n\\n      gsap.fromTo(\\n        smallEl,\\n        { y: 0 },\\n        {\\n          y: () => getMaxTravel(),\\n          ease: \'none\',\\n          scrollTrigger: {\\n            trigger: largeEl,\\n            start: \'top 22%\',\\n            end: \'bottom 86%\',\\n            scrub: 0.25,\\n            invalidateOnRefresh: true,\\n          },\\n        }\\n      );\\n    });\\n\\n    mm.add(\'(max-width: 1023px)\', () => {\\n      gsap.set(smallEl, { clearProps: \'all\' });\\n    });\\n\\n    const refreshTimer = window.setTimeout(() => {\\n      ScrollTrigger.refresh();\\n    }, 250);\\n\\n    return () => {\\n      window.clearTimeout(refreshTimer);\\n      mm.revert();\\n    };\\n  }, [activePage]);\",\"StartLine\":32,\"TargetContent\":\"  const [savedBookings, setSavedBookings] = useState<ConfirmedDemoBooking[]>([]);\\n\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    if (openingStage === \'complete\') return;\\n    const t1 = window.setTimeout(() => {\\n      setOpeningStage(\'revealing\');\\n    }, 450);\\n    const t2 = window.setTimeout(() => {\\n      setOpeningStage(\'complete\');\\n    }, 1500);\\n    return () => {\\n      window.clearTimeout(t1);\\n      window.clearTimeout(t2);\\n    };\\n  }, [openingStage]);\"},{\"AllowMultiple\":false,\"EndLine\":362,\"ReplacementContent\":\"              {/* Part B: Odyss\303\251e Asymmetrical Dual-Video & Giant Vertical Macro Composition (`image_77d66d8b.png`)\\n                  Left small video + caption scrolls smoothly from the top edge all the way to the bottom edge of the tall vertical right-hand video */}\\n              <div\\n                ref={philosophyGridRef}\\n                data-testid=\\\"philosophy-dual-video-grid\\\"\\n                className=\\\"mx-auto max-w-[1440px] px-4 sm:px-6 md:px-7 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-0 items-start lg:items-stretch\\\"\\n              >\\n                {/* Left-Center Small Macro Video + Caption Underneath (col-start-5 col-span-2) \342\200\224 stretches to match right video height so inner block travels all the way to the end */}\\n                <div className=\\\"lg:col-start-5 lg:col-span-2 pb-12 lg:pb-0 relative\\\">\\n                  <div\\n                    ref={philosophySmallCardRef}\\n                    data-testid=\\\"philosophy-small-sticky-card\\\"\\n                    className=\\\"will-change-transform\\\"\\n                  >\\n                    <div className=\\\"aspect-[4/5] w-full overflow-hidden bg-[#D5D7DB]\\\">\\n                      <MediaSlot\\n                        media={mediaSlots.spreadLeft}\\n                        priority={true}\\n                        subtleMotion={false}\\n                        className=\\\"h-full w-full grayscale contrast-105\\\"\\n                      />\\n                    </div>\\n                    <p className=\\\"font-basel mt-4 pr-4 pb-1 text-[13px] leading-[1.55] text-[#18224B]\\\">\\n                      Behind every treatment lies a commitment to science, research and refinement, ensuring results that are safe, precise and enduring.\\n                    </p>\\n                  </div>\\n                </div>\\n\\n                {/* Right Giant Vertical Macro Skin & Lips Video (col-start-7 col-span-5) \342\200\224 elongated vertical proportion */}\\n                <div\\n                  ref={philosophyLargeCardRef}\\n                  data-testid=\\\"philosophy-large-video-card\\\"\\n                  className=\\\"lg:col-start-7 lg:col-span-5 aspect-[3/4.6] lg:aspect-auto lg:h-[168vh] lg:min-h-[1260px] w-full overflow-hidden bg-[#E5DDD5]\\\"\\n                >\\n                  <MediaSlot\\n                    media={{\\n                      id: \'macro-lips-right\',\\n                      videoPath: \'/videos/approach-3.mp4\',\\n                      enableVideo: true,\\n                      posterPath: \'/images/spread-left-lips.jpg\',\\n                      alt: \'Extreme macro close-up of luminous skin texture and lips\',\\n                      focalPoint: \'center center\',\\n                    }}\\n                    priority={true}\\n                    subtleMotion={true}\\n                    className=\\\"h-full w-full\\\"\\n                  />\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n            </section>\",\"StartLine\":316,\"TargetContent\":\"              {/* Part B: Odyss\303\251e Asymmetrical Dual-Video & Giant Macro Lips/Skin Composition (`image_77d66d8b.png`)\\n                  Left small video + caption stays sticky and travels down alongside the taller right-hand video as the user scrolls */}\\n              <div\\n                data-testid=\\\"philosophy-dual-video-grid\\\"\\n                className=\\\"mx-auto max-w-[1440px] px-4 sm:px-6 md:px-7 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-0 items-start lg:items-stretch\\\"\\n              >\\n                {/* Left-Center Small Macro Video + Caption Underneath (col-start-5 col-span-2) \342\200\224 stretches to match right video height so inner sticky block glides along it */}\\n                <div className=\\\"lg:col-start-5 lg:col-span-2 pb-12 lg:pb-0 relative\\\">\\n                  <div\\n                    data-testid=\\\"philosophy-small-sticky-card\\\"\\n                    className=\\\"lg:sticky lg:top-24\\\"\\n                  >\\n                    <div className=\\\"aspect-[4/5] w-full overflow-hidden bg-[#D5D7DB]\\\">\\n                      <MediaSlot\\n                        media={mediaSlots.spreadLeft}\\n                        priority={true}\\n                        subtleMotion={false}\\n                        className=\\\"h-full w-full grayscale contrast-105\\\"\\n                      />\\n                    </div>\\n                    <p className=\\\"font-basel mt-4 pr-4 pb-1 text-[13px] leading-[1.55] text-[#18224B]\\\">\\n                      Behind every treatment lies a commitment to science, research and refinement, ensuring results that are safe, precise and enduring.\\n                    </p>\\n                  </div>\\n                </div>\\n\\n                {/* Right Giant Macro Skin & Lips Video/Portrait (col-start-7 col-span-5) \342\200\224 tall container so the small left card scrolls along its length */}\\n                <div\\n                  data-testid=\\\"philosophy-large-video-card\\\"\\n                  className=\\\"lg:col-start-7 lg:col-span-5 aspect-[4/5] lg:aspect-auto lg:h-[132vh] lg:min-h-[920px] w-full overflow-hidden bg-[#E5DDD5]\\\"\\n                >\\n                  <MediaSlot\\n                    media={{\\n                      id: \'macro-lips-right\',\\n                      videoPath: \'/videos/approach-3.mp4\',\\n                      enableVideo: true,\\n                      posterPath: \'/images/spread-left-lips.jpg\',\\n                      alt: \'Extreme macro close-up of luminous skin texture and lips\',\\n                      focalPoint: \'center center\',\\n                    }}\\n                    priority={true}\\n                    subtleMotion={true}\\n                    className=\\\"h-full w-full\\\"\\n                  />\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n            </section>\"}],\"TargetFile\":\"/src/App.tsx\",\"toolAction\":\"Updating Philosophy dual-video GSAP scroll and vertical height in App.tsx\",\"toolSummary\":\"Update Philosophy dual-video GSAP scroll and vertical height in App.tsx\"}"
