approach\\n                  </h2>\\n                  <p className=\\\"font-basel text-[13px] leading-[1.6] text-[#18224B]/90\\\">\\n                    Every treatment at <span className=\\\"font-brand tracking-[0.04em]\\\">NOVA</span> is carefully tailored to your lifestyle, your goals, your unique skin type and the time you have to restore.\\n                  </p>\\n                  <p className=\\\"font-basel text-[13px] leading-[1.6] text-[#18224B]/90\\\">\\n                    Learn about the rituals that define our approach and the specialists who bring it to life.\\n                  </p>\\n                </div>\\n\\n                {/* Right Column: Two Edge-to-Edge Duotone Cards (`TREATMENTS` | `ABOUT`) */}\\n                <div className=\\\"lg:col-start-7 lg:col-span-6 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-0\\\">\\n                  <button\\n                    type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                    onClick={() => handleNavigatePage(\'treatments\')}\\n                    className=\\\"group cursor-pointer relative aspect-[4/5] w-full overflow-hidden bg-[#687189] focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-[#18224B]\\\"\\n                  >\\n                    <img\\n                      src=\\\"/images/chapter-4-rituals.jpg\\\"\\n                      alt=\\\"Explore Nova Treatments\\\"\\n                      className=\\\"h-full w-full object-cover grayscale mix-blend-luminosity opacity-70 group-hover:mix-blend-normal group-hover:grayscale-0 group-hover:opacity-100 group-hover:scale-105 transition-all duration-700\\\"\\n                    />\\n                    <div className=\\\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-[#545E78]/45 group-hover:opacity-10 transition-opacity duration-700\\\" />\\n                    <div className=\\\"absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center\\\">\\n                      <span className=\\\"text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[#FBF9F5] drop-shadow\\\">\\n                        Treatments