    summary: "Based on a search for locations, businesses, and addresses matching these details in Lucknow:\n\n* **Kingship by Kahlon** is a well-known hotel and banquet property located in **Vrindavan Colony (Vrindavan Yojna)**, Lucknow[1][2][3]. Its precise location details on Google Maps:\n  * **Address:** Plot No. 16/COM-11, 12, 13, 14, Sector 16, Vrindavan Yojna, Lucknow, Uttar Pradesh 226029[3]\n  * **Nearby Landmark:** Close to SGPGI Hospital / PGI Road[1][4].\n\n* Regarding **\"Nova Unisex Salon\"** at this specific commercial setup: \n  * While *Kingship by Kahlon* and commercial complexes in Sector 16 / Sector 12 of Vrindavan Yojna host various facilities (such as *Lakme Salon* located nearby in Kahlon Emporium, Sector 12)[5], an exact standalone listing matching \"Nova Unisex Salon\" directly tied to Kingship by Kahlon does not prominently show up under that exact name. There are multiple popular unisex salons scattered across Vrindavan Colony (such as Jawed Habib, Naturals, New Looks, Heer & Harry, etc.)[6][7][8]. \n\nIf you are looking for directions or trying to pin down a newly opened outlet inside or right next to the Kingship by Kahlon property, it is recommended to search directly for **\"Kingship by Kahlon, Sector 16, Vrindavan Yojna\"** on Google Maps[3] to navigate to the main complex, where local signage can guide you to adjacent commercial shops and service spaces.\n\nSources:\n[1] [google.com.np](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHSOmlneWRV45Cs2furMMwUy0gqYHIyxnIS-WrXokZDPEW53DQ9OlrkAwi_BWkYwcYpAapdmWrC8RKTkahniP8KyExzmPz33JKRLW6eHikk4W2QTGQLLdqQWxJlcka7DNswdsIUoKhgyl9dOYV0BkDdmBtyGlz3dfko9FpIkPoADL2LIxC_8MLaZQW9Pytg33sS52CQikZk8ZHo4fzuzV20tsXptJa8ZuCVUi3-UlolzcWiHKw4l0eh77a-1OxjHMtZuwW_Rmx5VLb1VlFP2mjVcLhy8uFMGseC1rD2iPQt4oOuyFlpdmqLjlFP2jydQvDXNRoNpWX6iUF45u41PIDyZzVT15LzS9nLjAyVOmuqvBKvTnRPfb0D501wv6cboqgkW0p_H_HVnwWdCFpX9o0YUaLUKUgB9C8_dZ1pqEzeTC-YO0TGH_jr4YYcfVi25uBoqMnR2QMqwp3FX7gbOd9QIU8thxD-OVRbzb918