  planner_response {
    response: "I have upgraded the bottom rolling pearl sphere and cursor experience to match your reference screenshot:\n\n- **Custom `\342\227\217 Hershita` Cursor Follower**: Moving your mouse anywhere inside the grey studio cyclorama area now hides the default pointer and smoothly tracks the cursor with the floating white dot and **`Hershita`** badge (`\342\227\217 Hershita`), resting just to the right of the sphere when idle.\n- **Photorealistic Satin Pearl-Champagne Sphere**: Rebuilt the sphere with a warm champagne-taupe crown, bright right-face studio softbox reflection, Fresnel rim lighting, a long directional cast shadow to the left, and a vertical 3D meridian engraving that curves pole-to-pole across the sphere surface."
