A\" [ref=e10] [cursor=pointer]:\n            - /url: \"#top\"\n          - paragraph [ref=e11]: Bespoke hair, skin & beauty artistry for timeless elegance.\n          - navigation \"Opening Horizon Navigation\" [ref=e12]:\n            - button \"Treatments\" [ref=e13] [cursor=pointer]\n            - button \"Concerns\" [ref=e14] [cursor=pointer]\n            - button \"About\" [ref=e15] [cursor=pointer]\n            - button \"Book Consultation\" [ref=e16] [cursor=pointer]\n        - generic [ref=e17]:\n          - generic \"Close-up editorial beauty film showing luminous natural skin texture and botanical serum ritual\" [ref=e20]\n          - generic [ref=e21]: Scroll to enter \342\206\223\n        - img \"Macro editorial photograph showing natural skin texture, pores and facial details\" [ref=e24]\n      - region \"Sanctuary Introduction\" [ref=e25]:\n        - generic [ref=e26]:\n          - img \"Editorial profile portrait of a serene model blending softly into warm ivory light\" [ref=e30]\n          - generic [ref=e31]:\n            - heading \"At NOVA, we believe beauty is a personal expression of who you are. Step into our sanctuary for unhurried rituals shaped around your natural rhythm.\" [level=2] [ref=e32]\n            - generic [ref=e33]:\n              - paragraph [ref=e34]: True radiance rarely comes from haste. Every appointment begins with attentive listening\342\200\224observing how you live, how your skin responds to the season, and what brings you a sense of calm restoration.\n              - button \"Book Consultation\" [ref=e36] [cursor=pointer]\n      - generic [ref=e39]:\n        - region [ref=e40]:\n          - generic [ref=e41]:\n            - generic [ref=e43]:\n              - generic [ref=e44]:\n                - generic [ref=e45]: \"01\"\n                - generic [ref=e46]: /\n                - generic [ref=e47]: \"04\"\n              - heading \"Why NOVA?\" [level=2] [ref=e48]\n              - generic [ref=e49]:\n                - button \"Previous chapter\" [ref=e50] [cursor=pointer]: \342\206\220\n                - button \"Next chapter\" [ref=e51] [cursor=pointer]: \342\206\222\n            - generic [ref=e52]:\n              - article [ref=e53]:\n                - button \"Serene facial treatment ritual in warm diffused light (1). Active Chapter A considered experience More than an appointment, Maison Aura is a quiet pause. From warm linen and softened acoustics to unhurried transition time between rituals, every detail is composed to restore stillness.\" [pressed] [ref=e54] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - generic \"Serene facial treatment ritual in warm diffused light\" [ref=e58]\n                  - generic [ref=e59]:\n                    - generic [ref=e60]:\n                      - text: (1).\n                      - generic [ref=e61]: Active Chapter\n                    - generic [ref=e62]:\n                      - heading \"A considered experience\" [level=3] [ref=e63]\n                      - paragraph [ref=e64]: More than an appointment, Maison Aura is a quiet pause. From warm linen and softened acoustics to unhurried transition time between rituals, every detail is composed to restore stillness.\n              - article [ref=e65]:\n                - button \"Macro beauty portrait highlighting natural skin texture and hydration (2). Care tailored to you No two complexions or schedules are alike. Each facial, manicure, or makeup session is adapted on the day of your visit to match your skin\342\200\231s current condition and personal preferences.\" [ref=e66] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - generic \"Macro beauty portrait highlighting natural skin texture and hydration\" [ref=e70]\n                  - generic [ref=e71]:\n                    - generic [ref=e72]: (2).\n                    - generic [ref=e73]:\n                      - heading \"Care tailored to you\" [level=3] [ref=e74]\n                      - paragraph [ref=e75]: No two complexions or schedules are alike. Each facial, manicure, or makeup session is adapted on the day of your visit to match your skin\342\200\231s current condition and personal preferences.\n              - article [ref=e76]:\n                - button \"Esthetician hands performing a precise, gentle facial massage (3). Skilled beauty professionals Our estheticians, nail artists, and makeup specialists unite refined manual technique with a gentle, observant touch\342\200\224prioritizing comfort, hygiene, and timeless aesthetic harmony.\" [ref=e77] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - generic \"Esthetician hands performing a precise, gentle facial massage\" [ref=e81]\n                  - generic [ref=e82]:\n                    - generic [ref=e83]: (3).\n                    - generic [ref=e84]:\n                      - heading \"Skilled beauty professionals\" [level=3] [ref=e85]\n                      - paragraph [ref=e86]: Our estheticians, nail artists, and makeup specialists unite refined manual technique with a gentle, observant touch\342\200\224prioritizing comfort, hygiene, and timeless aesthetic harmony.\n              - article [ref=e87]:\n                - button \"Close-up of elegant hands and natural manicure ritual (4). The art of everyday rituals We believe beauty should feel effortless long after you leave our chair. We pair in-salon treatments with simple, sustainable home rituals that support healthy skin and nails every day.\" [ref=e88] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - generic \"Close-up of elegant hands and natural manicure ritual\" [ref=e92]\n                  - generic [ref=e93]:\n                    - generic [ref=e94]: (4).\n                    - generic [ref=e95]:\n                      - heading \"The art of everyday rituals\" [level=3] [ref=e96]\n                      - paragraph [ref=e97]: We believe beauty should feel effortless long after you leave our chair. We pair in-salon treatments with simple, sustainable home rituals that support healthy skin and nails every day.\